WEBVTT

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:30.724
They don't have internet
in the 21st century.

00:09:30.748 --> 00:09:33.339
We don't have electricity,

00:09:33.363 --> 00:09:37.084
and it is the darkest place
on earth right now.

00:09:38.618 --> 00:09:42.403
Now I want to say something
to my fellow North Koreans

00:09:42.427 --> 00:09:44.632
who are living in that darkness.

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.805
They might not believe this,

00:09:47.829 --> 00:09:52.681
but I want to tell them
that an alternative life is possible.

00:09:52.705 --> 00:09:54.043
Be free.

00:09:55.709 --> 00:09:59.459
From my experience,

00:09:59.483 --> 00:10:02.593
literally anything is possible.